  <section class="hero grid-overlay">
    <div class="container hero-wrap">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> Site finance control</div>
        <h1>Construction Ka<br>Poora <span class="accent">Hisaab Kitab</span><br>Ab Digital</h1>
        <p>
          Thekedaari construction hisaab kitab software ke through aap site expense, labour payment, material purchase,
          petty cash, udhaar, supplier balance aur project wise profit-loss ko structured tareeke se dekh sakte ho.
          Jitna clear hisaab, utna better business control.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://thekedaari.com/register">Free Setup</a>
        </div>
        <div class="trust"><span>Designed for real site accounting, not generic bookkeeping.</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="float-card fc-1"><div class="float-icon">🧾</div><div><strong>Expense Logged</strong><span>Material & petty cash</span></div></div>
        <div class="float-card fc-2"><div class="float-icon">📚</div><div><strong>Ledger Updated</strong><span>Worker and site balance</span></div></div>
        <div class="float-card fc-3"><div class="float-icon">🏦</div><div><strong>Cash In / Out</strong><span>Live finance visibility</span></div></div>
        <div class="float-card fc-4"><div class="float-icon">📈</div><div><strong>Profit View</strong><span>Project wise report</span></div></div>
        <div class="phone">
          <div class="screen">
            <div class="app-top"><span>Thekedaari</span><span>Hisaab</span></div>
            <div class="profile-card">
              <div class="profile-header">Site Account Summary</div>
              <div class="profile-body">
                <div>Total Expense: ₹68,400</div>
                <div>Current Balance: ₹12,450</div>
                <a class="install-btn" href="https://thekedaari.com/register">Track now</a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="dashboard-grid">
              <div class="mini-card"><small>Expense</small><strong>₹68K</strong></div>
              <div class="mini-card"><small>Receipts</small><strong>₹95K</strong></div>
              <div class="mini-card"><small>Balance</small><strong>₹12K</strong></div>
              <div class="mini-card"><small>Profit</small><strong>₹14K</strong></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="features">
    <div class="container center">
      <h2 class="section-title">Construction hisaab kitab ko systematic banao</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Ye page accounting intent ke liye optimized hai. Iska focus site kharcha, payment aur profit-loss clarity par hai.</p>
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card"><div class="icon-box">💸</div><h3>Daily Site Expense</h3><p>Diesel, transport, cement, petty cash, labour payment aur miscellaneous entries ko same system me rakho.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="icon-box">📘</div><h3>Ledger & Balance</h3><p>Worker, vendor, site ya project ke hisaab se clear balance aur transaction history.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="icon-box">📈</div><h3>Profit Loss Reports</h3><p>Approximate margin samajhne me help milti hai aur cost leakage jaldi pakad me aata hai.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="accounting">
    <div class="container split">
      <div class="panel">
        <h3>Why site accounting often goes wrong</h3>
        <p>
          Construction projects me hisaab alag alag jagah likha jata hai: diary, chits, Excel, WhatsApp ya yaadash. Isliye month end par exact numbers nikalna mushkil ho jata hai.
          Thekedaari ek disciplined digital record deta hai jisse aapko site ke asli numbers milte hain.
        </p>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li>Daily entry discipline</li>
          <li>Expense categorization</li>
          <li>Worker wage tracking</li>
          <li>Material record support</li>
          <li>Cash flow visibility</li>
          <li>Project wise profit view</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <h3>Ideal for Indian construction workflow</h3>
        <p>
          Ye koi generic accounting tool nahi hai. Ye especially contractors aur site teams ke liye practical format me bana hai jahan petty cash,
          labour, site expense aur daily entries core requirement hoti hain.
        </p>
        <div class="kpis">
          <div class="kpi"><strong>Clear</strong><span>Daily records</span></div>
          <div class="kpi"><strong>Smart</strong><span>Ledger visibility</span></div>
          <div class="kpi"><strong>Live</strong><span>Site balance</span></div>
          <div class="kpi"><strong>Useful</strong><span>Profit insight</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="how">
    <div class="container center">
      <h2 class="section-title">Daily hisaab management ka flow</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Simple routine se clear construction accounts maintain kiye ja sakte hain.</p>
      <div class="panel" style="text-align:left; margin-top:22px;">
        <div class="steps">
          <div class="step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div><h4>Projects aur expense heads setup karo</h4><p>Site structure create karke categories define karo.</p></div></div>
          <div class="step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div><h4>Roz expense aur payment entries karo</h4><p>Labour, material aur petty cash ko same day enter karna best rahega.</p></div></div>
          <div class="step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div><h4>Balance aur margin monitor karo</h4><p>Dashboard par real-time cash flow aur profitability dekhte raho.</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta" id="cta">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-box">
        <div class="cta-wrap">
          <div>
            <h2>Construction hisaab kitab ko clear banana hai?</h2>
            <p>Thekedaari use karo aur site expense, labour payment aur project balance ko one place me control karo.</p>
          </div>
